        "title": "Ai lungmei kandih man puni",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai lungmei kandih man puni,",
            "He tabui nung rui man ni cho?",
            "Bumang thanmei nun le Raguang -",
            "Jao hou khang khuan ngam mak.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Jerusalem jikdui,",
            "Raguang rui rianra kheang mei 3)_;",
            "Siangding thing kross rukhou jai thauna,",
            "Pap khang kheang lou the.",
            "",
            "2. Kheang loumei 3)_ ai ning ngam mak,",
            "Ata jaujian mei Laujiu Nah;",
            "Bethlehem namdai khou puanmei 3)_,",
            "Raguang Nah dai e.",
            "",
            "3. Poubaumei ta ai ning ngam mak,",
            "Kalvari khou kheang lou mei 3)_;",
            "Adi rianra khuan ni poubaumei,",
            "Muang rui sangam mak.",
            "",
            "4. Ai rui mu lak khe poubaumei,",
            "Akhang rui rianra lou mei 3)_;",
            "Airui thei mei ngan na ning bam ni,",
            "Guloumei puta."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
